1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
I'm going to read your mind

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:03,550
Just follow along
and do the math with me!

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,920
Think of any
two-digit number

4
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:12,290
Add its
two digits together

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:18,170
Subtract that sum
from your number

6
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:21,816
Find your answer on the board
and remember its symbol!

7
00:00:21,866 --> 00:00:25,596
Need more time?
Press and hold the screen to pause

8
00:00:26,946 --> 00:00:31,350
Got it?
Now I'll read your mind…

9
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,370
Your symbol is…
the gold star!

10
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,570
If I got it right,
comment "star"!

11
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,890
How did I know?

12
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:39,470
Your answer is always
one of these nine squares

13
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,540
9 · 18 · 27 … 81 are all stars!
The other stars are just decoys

14
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,138
37 = 3 bars of ten + 7 ones

15
00:00:43,188 --> 00:00:45,770
Now take away 3 + 7 = 10 blocks

16
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,240
Each bar has 9 left: 9 × 3 = 27

17
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,520
Any number works: 9 left in every bar!

18
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:51,890
The answer is always a multiple of 9,
so it's always the star!

19
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:56,350
Now you're the magician! Try it on Mom or Dad:
the two digits of their answer always add up to 9

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,350
NEXT: Put in any number and you get 1089?
